  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-01-17T13:16:40.322Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Parameters should not be persistent on legacy avatars because they were designed when the creators assumed they would reset after world change and restart.\nNot every player will be aware of this change when it goes live and will be surprised by his old avatars behaving differently.\nPeople should have to update their avatar to behave in the new way and not have put effort into making them work like before.",
